    "title": {
     "label": "Watch Ultra"
    },
    "content": {
     "label": "Sometimes when I track with phone and watch, journal crashes and doesn\u2019t record night, I wish phone app automatically triggered iWatch to start and vice versa, having to start both makes them crash. \n\nI wish instead of the swipe up to stop recording that it was a press/hold, so many times I accidentally cancel when I swipe to go to another app l. \n\nAlso wish you could record naps or continue an interrupted night specially with a newborn/toddler or red eye, when nights are perfect allow us to track as such",
