    "title": {
     "label": "Misleading Premium Features"
    },
    "content": {
     "label": "I\u2019ve had this app since 2021. I was an \u201cearly adopter\u201d for the premium features. But certain features became inaccessible again behind a new Premium wall. While I was still able to use the app the same way, I decided to upgrade to the \u201cnew\u201d Premium. I am currently subscribed for $20/year, yet I get error messages stating my subscription is for another account with the same email address I\u2019m already logged in with. And I still don\u2019t have access to the new premium features even though I\u2019m being charged $20/year. I am sick of the constant error messages and the misleading & changing features for Premium users. Something about this app\u2019s business practice feels shady. I have cancelled and am looking for other sleep tracking apps.",
     "attributes": {
      "type": "text"
     }
    },
